  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>부피가 일정할때 온도와 압력의 관계 알아보는 실험하기</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00b1cfd9a77d848d2b70437f18a220991c019728\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/00b1cfd9a77d848d2b70437f18a220991c019728\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">감압기 준비합니다</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br>&#160;<br>디지털 센서는<br>이지메이커 메인보드 하나<br>배터리 하나<br>기압센서 하나<br>온도센서 하나<br>준비합니다<br>&#160;<br>이지메이커 메인보드와 배터리를 이용하면</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">무선센서가 됩니다.<br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/19fb4b7175f7b321f4b0f5bb9f8c4adb5ef1942f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/19fb4b7175f7b321f4b0f5bb9f8c4adb5ef1942f\" data-origin-width=\"884\" data-origin-height=\"525\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">위와 같이 이지메이커 블록코딩을 합니다<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>그리고 메인보드에 컴파일 후</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a89d264c4084f4304c2cef43db3c7fe1d5cb570e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a89d264c4084f4304c2cef43db3c7fe1d5cb570e\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"773\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bc1647479f09f763a9dd48b279dc558f2eb62e22\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bc1647479f09f763a9dd48b279dc558f2eb62e22\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b72d8c5f24335aaebbe255027f63805c72a5b63a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b72d8c5f24335aaebbe255027f63805c72a5b63a\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/66daf9d26df680dd50f7b53132c6320629070e35\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/66daf9d26df680dd50f7b53132c6320629070e35\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>천천히 시간(대략 5~7초)을 두며 감압기에 공기를 빼냅니다.<br>&#160;<br>실험을 다하고<br>메인보드 SD 카드를 빼내어<br>데이터를 확인해봅니다.<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>데이터를 아래 엑셀파일입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/21341525103b1087a1723de41f2bd33e0f924ecf?download\" data-file-name=\"기체 온도-압력 관계 실험.xlsx\" data-file-size=\"29441\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DeXoO%26dataid%3D147%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20250329014042&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F21341525103b1087a1723de41f2bd33e0f924ecf')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">기체 온도-압력 관계 실험</span><span class=\"type\">.xlsx</span></div><div class=\"size\">28.75KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">데이터를 바탕으로</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">그래프를 그려보니</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/593da5b1bbdc49ef658d852c6b16e49f26f4d5b6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/593da5b1bbdc49ef658d852c6b16e49f26f4d5b6\" data-origin-width=\"752\" data-origin-height=\"452\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">아이참<br>일정한 시간 간격으로 공기를 빼내지 않았나 봅니다 ㅠㅠ<br>&#160;<br>x축은 압력, 기압단위인 hPa(헥토파스칼)이며<br>y축은 온도, 단위는도씨 입니다.<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>그래도 이론적으로 말하는&#160;<br>압력과 온도의 관계 그래프가 나온 듯 보입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\\<br>&#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
